{"topicSections":[{"title":"Sampling Types","anchor":"Sampling-Types","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftLLM\/documentation\/SwiftLLM\/Sampler","doc:\/\/SwiftLLM\/documentation\/SwiftLLM\/LLMOptions"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"During autoregressive language generation, logits from the transformer output layer are converted into probability distributions over the vocabulary:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"$$P(w_i) = \\frac{\\exp(z_i \/ T)}{\\sum_j \\exp(z_j \/ T)}$$","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Where $T$ is the "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Temperature"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"anchor":"1-Supported-Sampling-Methods","type":"heading","text":"1. Supported Sampling Methods","level":2},{"alignments":["left","left","left"],"rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Parameter"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Mathematical Formulation"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Effect"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Temperature ($T$)","type":"text"}]}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Softmax scaling factor"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Lower = deterministic\/focused; Higher = creative\/diverse"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Top-K","type":"text"}]}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Truncate to top $K$ probabilities","type":"text"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Eliminates low-probability tail tokens"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Top-P (Nucleus)"}],"type":"strong"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Smallest set with $\\sum P(w) \\ge p$","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Dynamically adjusts pool size based on confidence","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Repetition Penalty"}],"type":"strong"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"$z_i \\leftarrow z_i \/ \\theta$ if $w_i \\in \\text{history}$"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Penalizes tokens already generated in current context"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]],"type":"table","header":"row"},{"anchor":"2-Code-Example","type":"heading","text":"2. Code Example","level":2},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import SwiftLLM","","let params = GenerationParameters(","    temperature: 0.7,","    topP: 0.9,","    topK: 40,","    repetitionPenalty: 1.1,","    maxTokens: 100",")","","let outputText = try await model.generate(prompt: \"Explain neural attention:\", parameters: params)"]}]}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"API Collection","role":"collectionGroup","modules":[{"name":"SwiftLLM"}],"title":"Token Sampling & Decoding Strategies"},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiftLLM\/documentation\/SwiftLLM"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Control autoregressive language generation with Temperature, Top-P Nucleus, Top-K, and Repetition Penalty.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiftLLM\/documentation\/SwiftLLM\/SamplingAndDecodingStrategies","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftllm\/samplinganddecodingstrategies"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"kind":"article","references":{"doc://SwiftLLM/documentation/SwiftLLM/Sampler":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Sampler"}],"title":"Sampler","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftLLM\/documentation\/SwiftLLM\/Sampler","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swiftllm\/